{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t行政長官李家超祝賀當選的選委會委員，形容今次選舉充分展現愛國者之間良性競爭，亦感謝投票人積極投票，優中選優，助力香港未來發展和改革，包括落實《香港第一個五年規劃》。<br/>\n<br/>\n立法會發言人說，整個投票過程公開、公平、公正，又安全、有序、高效，任何對選舉的無理攻擊抹黑不攻自破。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T23:24:11.764304+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T22:40:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T03:02:24.415521+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T23:17:39.524234+00:00","content_hash":"12f8b15256751e869dfe4954374e703ef33271134713daf66f405dea34f816e8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}